&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh Group is the world&#39;s leading integrated food solutions provider, with a global portfolio of brands spanning meal kits, ready-to-eat meals, and specialty products. From our Berlin headquarters, we build and run the technology that delivers millions of meals every week.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome team players who thrive in a dynamic environment, lead with ownership, and bring diverse perspectives to the table. If you are motivated to grow in a culture that champions speed and agility, data-driven decision making, and customer centricity, we would like to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Foundations Alliance builds the tools and infrastructure that empower engineering teams across HelloFresh. Cloud Runtime sits at the center of it: we provide a reliable and highly performant multi-cluster container platform so that every HelloFresh engineer can deploy services with 99.99% uptime, high performance, low latency, and minimal operational overhead.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Engineering Manager for Cloud Runtime, you will lead a squad of platform engineers who own the container platform, networking, and traffic routing that more than 1,000 production services depend on across Europe, North America, and Australia and New Zealand. You will partner closely with our Product Manager to turn a defined platform strategy into a roadmap the team can execute, and you will be accountable for the reliability and cost of what we run.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on leadership role. Your day will not be spent writing code, but you will be close enough to the system to read a pull request, follow a debugging session, and challenge the team on any technical decision they bring you, from an architecture proposal to an incident postmortem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, grow, and support a distributed squad of platform engineers, with team members based in Berlin and Poland, owning hiring, development, and performance for the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain an engineering roadmap spanning one to two quarters, and make explicit trade-offs between features, timelines, and quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive our core platform commitments: expanding into a highly available platform with failover between pre-provisioned clusters, increasing adoption of our container platform and multi-region deployments, and reducing infrastructure cost through networking and compute optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the squad&#39;s operational metrics and be accountable for moving them&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate and role-model postmortems, and drive the follow-through on action items&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage relationships with key infrastructure vendors and work with Security on audit and compliance requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the Observability, Release Engineering, and Security squads, where our roadmaps are tightly coupled and dependencies run in both directions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster an inclusive and open working environment, and create the kind of documentation and knowledge sharing that makes the team less dependent on any single person&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a team of engineers, including hiring, performance management, and career development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading a team that is split across more than one location, and the habits that make that work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong technical background in cloud infrastructure, with hands-on experience of Kubernetes and at least one major cloud platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with the surrounding ecosystem: service mesh, API gateways, infrastructure as code, GitOps-style deployment, and secrets management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to contribute technically when needed, whether that means reviewing code, pairing on a problem, or helping debug an incident&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning production systems with meaningful availability targets, including incident response and on-call practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Judgement about when a decision is reversible and when it is not, and a willingness to front-load design effort on the ones that are not&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong stakeholder management, and the ability to say no to a loud request that is not on the roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written communication and strong asynchronous collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for people who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh Group better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences, so even if you don&#39;t tick all the boxes but think you&#39;d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What we offer&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Financial Wellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’ll receive a competitive salary package, including a HelloFresh-subsidized pension scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy savings on your weekly HelloFresh box.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Save with discount schemes with corporate benefits and Vorteile.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support your mental wellbeing with access to platforms like Headspace and Spill.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay active with 24/7 office gym access, a discounted Urban Sports Club membership, and other wellbeing resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Flexibility &amp;amp; Work-Life&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance your life with our flexible hybrid model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recharge with sabbatical leave options in addition to standard time off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Get to work with ease through sustainable travel perks and transportation benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Career &amp;amp; Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embrace &quot;Learning Never Stops&quot; with internal training, the HelloFresh Academy, and a dedicated budget for German language courses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Culture &amp;amp; Environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy tasty in-office meal deals and fresh food options.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We support working families with parent-friendly policies, an in-office kids corner, and an on-site babysitter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#Engineering&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-top.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1280&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About RELEX:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;RELEX Solutions create cutting-edge supply chain and retail planning software. Within our platforms, we have the power and potential to increase adaptability, efficiency, and sustainability in the consumer goods and retail value chain. Our impact is tangible; from sustainability and eliminating waste to delighting customers and delivering great tailored tech solutions, we’re curious and passionate challenge-seekers creating the future of retail today.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We’re currently a global team of 2000+ employees working from offices in the US (Atlanta), UK, Germany, Sweden, Norway, Denmark, France, Italy, Spain, Portugal, Singapore, Australia, and our headquarters in Helsinki, Finland. We work in small teams where everyone’s input is valued. We’re passionate about what we do, we like putting our skills to the test, and we make sure we have fun during the process — because life is supposed to be fun.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;RELEX Solutions is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for an experienced (Senior) Marketing Manager to take ownership of various field marketing projects across Europe and with a specific focus on the DACH region. In this role, you will be responsible for executing strategic marketing initiatives that drive demand generation, strengthen partnerships, and accelerate sales opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with the Field Marketing, Sales, Business Development, and Customer Success teams to develop and implement localized marketing strategies that align with our key industry verticals and buyer personas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers the opportunity to shape and execute key components of our EMEA go-to-market strategy, including trade shows, customer activations, executive events, and digital campaigns. If you are a strategic thinker with hands-on marketing expertise, a deep understanding of B2B enterprise sales cycles, and experience engaging senior decision-makers in retail, wholesale, and manufacturing industries, this role is for you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Event &amp;amp; Field Marketing Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute integrated event marketing programs that align with business objectives, including in-person trade shows, conferences, association activations, executive briefings, and virtual experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the event calendar and execution of regional events, including contract negotiations, vendor management, site selection, registration, agenda planning, staffing, on-site production, signage, and content development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and manage custom events that engage both customers and prospects, driving lead generation and strategic account engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive marketing and promotional strategies around RELEX Live events across EMEA, ensuring alignment with pipeline goals and industry engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and develop co-marketing initiatives with partners, media, and associations with joint value propositions incl. events, webinars, campaigns, and content syndication.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and evaluate industry events to determine sponsorship and engagement opportunities aligned with RELEX’s target verticals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Marketing &amp;amp; Campaign Execution&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop promotional and engagement strategies to ensure event participation from the right audience at the right time, driving SQLs and qualified meetings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our solution experts, ABM, Global Campaigns, and Brand &amp;amp; Creative teams to develop high-impact content and assets (landing pages, videos, handouts, digital ads, social banners, etc.) tailored to our target sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute pre-, during-, and post-event campaigns that maximize attendance, brand awareness, and pipeline generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Tracking &amp;amp; Optimization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and measure event impact on pipeline, marketing-influenced revenue, and sales acceleration to refine future strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct pre- and post-event analysis to evaluate success metrics, optimize lead qualification processes, and ensure strong alignment with sales follow-up strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide data-driven insights to inform marketing decisions and improve ROI on event investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring to the Table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in B2B field and event marketing, preferably in technology, supply chain software, or enterprise SaaS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing both in-person and digital events as part of an integrated marketing strategy that supports pipeline acceleration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with sales and business development teams to align marketing initiatives with revenue goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of the B2B sales funnel, pipeline management, and the role field marketing plays in lead conversion and acceleration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional project management and prioritization skills, with the ability to manage multiple programs and stakeholders simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills with experience developing marketing content for executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A results-driven, self-motivated mindset with a passion for creating measurable business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sense of ownership, accountability, and a desire to contribute to RELEX’s growth in EMEA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferably experience within the Manufacturing industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are a global community of different cultures, voices, and experiences. We celebrate what makes us unique and connect through what we share, in an authentic and safe environment. Together we shape the future, and each other.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;If you feel this is the opportunity you don’t want to miss, you can apply by sending your cover letter and resume through the application form as soon as possible. If you have questions, Noemi ----- from our Talent Acquisition team is happy to answer them by email. Please note that we cannot process any applications through email.   &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Apply today and be part of the future. Be RELEX!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.relexsolutions.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/relex-greenhouse-banner-bottom.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;1280&quot; style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;About Baringa&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa is a global consulting firm that partners with leaders to drive change and create value. With deep industry expertise, and enabled by advanced technology, the firm helps clients to deliver with greater confidence and certainty. With over 2,000 people across the UK, Europe, North America, Asia and Australia, the firm combines global insight with local understanding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The firm works across energy and resources, financial services, government and public sector, consumer products and retail, pharmaceuticals and life sciences, manufacturing, and technology, media and telecoms, with capabilities spanning strategy, transformation and operational excellence – all powered by advanced technology, data, AI and digital innovation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clients value Baringa’s collaborative approach and the way its teams integrate seamlessly – all working with a shared understanding of what matters most. The firm is known for its kind, curious experts who listen closely and care deeply about client success as they help clients transform energy markets, modernise financial platforms, expand telecoms and digital networks through advanced data analytics, enable digital services in government, and unlock growth in consumer sectors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Great Place to Work &lt;/em&gt;around the world, Baringa has been recognised by the &lt;em&gt;Financial Times &lt;/em&gt;in 22 categories of its UK Leading Management Consultants rankings, and by &lt;em&gt;Forbes &lt;/em&gt;for four consecutive years as one of the World’s Best Management Consulting Firms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Technology and Cyber team are looking for an experienced Database and Analytics Engineer to join the team.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Baringa has grown so fast, and it continues to grow rapidly. Those new joiners keep on coming! We are a global function supporting the firm as it enters new markets. We are re-architecting and evolving our cloud-based business systems and infrastructure. We are on a mission to develop great technology products, deliver great services, and protect the trust our people and clients place in us. We have installed a new operating system for ourselves, and rebooted what was a corporate IT department into a corporate technology company, transforming the way we work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Now we are building for the next era of work. AI is becoming part of the fabric of how Baringa operates, and we are developing the products and platforms that will help colleagues find knowledge, act on insight, navigate complexity, and get work done with greater speed, quality, and confidence. Some of this will be visible through intelligent experiences and agentic systems. Some of it will sit beneath the surface: data products, workflow platforms, integrations, automations, cyber security, governance, and the architecture that makes all of it safe, scalable, resilient, and useful.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;So much to build on, so much to progress. So much to deliver. So much to play for!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you know what though? We are going to do it. All of it and more. We have the support to drive change. We have the belief. We are going to do great things. Come and join us!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What you will be doing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We are on a business systems modernization journey. You will help evolve and engineer the data, analytics and application solutions that underpin critical processes and products across the firm, balancing operational excellence with future scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a Principal Database &amp;amp; Analytics Engineer within the Technology Product team, you will take a hands-on role in designing, building and supporting robust data and application solutions that deliver measurable business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the engineering, optimisation and continuous improvement of our database estate, ensuring performance, resilience, security and maintainability remain at the heart of everything we build.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Owners, Engineers and business stakeholders to modernise legacy solutions, reducing technical debt and enabling more scalable, supportable and cloud-ready platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver meaningful reporting, analytics and data products that improve decision making and unlock insight across the firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and support business-critical applications, integrating data, automation and user experiences into solutions that solve real business problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a technical authority for database and analytics engineering, establishing best practice, mentoring colleagues and raising engineering standards across our Technology &amp;amp; Cyber function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Whilst this is an engineering role, we are a multi-skilled team. Providing proof of concepts, solving complex technical challenges and rolling up your sleeves to deliver great outcomes will be a core part of the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Your skills and experience&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in SQL Server and database engineering, including performance optimisation, schema design, data modelling and operational support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of relational database design principles, normalisation and data modelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to write complex SQL queries, stored procedures, views and functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong mathematical aptitude with the ability to analyse complex datasets and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of DAX and Power Query (M language).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Azure SQL Managed Instance (MI) - including configuration, connectivity, authentication, security and troubleshooting integration with cloud-based systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance tuning, query optimization, and indexing strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ETL processes and data integration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of data governance, data quality, and information security principles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with source control and software development lifecycle practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience delivering business applications, integrations and data-driven solutions that solve complex organisational challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent analytical and problem-solving skills, with the ability to translate business requirements into well-engineered technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and supporting reporting and analytics capabilities, ideally including Power BI and modern Microsoft data technologies including Fabric.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work across technical and non-technical audiences, adapting communication style to suit the stakeholder and situation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working in Agile environments and collaborating closely with Product Owners, Engineers and business stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, hands-on and able to balance strategic thinking with delivery-focused execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What a career at Baringa will give you&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;Putting&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(208, 0, 111);&quot;&gt;People&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;First.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 53, 142);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Baringa is a People First company and wellbeing is at the forefront of our culture. We recognise the importance of work-life balance and flexible working and provide our staff amazing benefits. Some of these benefits include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:200,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
