&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process Optimisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse current workflows and identify opportunities for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement streamlined processes to reduce inefficiencies and enhance productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage automation tools and best practices to optimise operational tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Team Efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor team performance metrics and identify bottlenecks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop strategies to maximise resource utilisation across teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster cross-functional collaboration to ensure smooth project delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous Improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and maintain a culture of continuous improvement across the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular process reviews and update documentation accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Train and mentor team members on optimised practices and methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operational Alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Align team goals with broader organisational objectives to ensure cohesive efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with leadership to set clear priorities and deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide regular progress reports and insights to stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Risk Management and Problem Solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify potential risks associated with process inefficiencies and address them proactively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a point of escalation for operational challenges and lead resolution efforts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance Reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and track project deliverables &amp;amp; performance across all teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and report on the team’s KPIs to measure success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data-driven insights to recommend and implement process enhancements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Skills and Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Has substantial experience in media, marketing, or the wider creative industries, and is eager to further their career within a global organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understands the intricacies of operational processes within large-scale, global teams, and can identify opportunities for improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is highly proactive, can take ownership of tasks, and leads with initiative to anticipate the needs of the business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Thrives both independently and in a team environment, with strong collaboration skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is highly organised, with the ability to manage multiple priorities and drive projects to successful completion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Is an adept problem solver, comfortable seeking clarity on complex issues, and quick to learn from feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrates enthusiasm for challenges and is committed to delivering high-quality outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office suite and other relevant tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organisational and project management skills, with the ability to streamline processes and optimise workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to convey complex ideas clearly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Logical thinking, strategic problem-solving abilities, and a deep understanding of operational efficiency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in managing teams or providing senior-level support across multiple functions&lt;/li&gt;
